      ],
      "source": "https://www.renvillemn.gov/?SEC=%7B240F5F0A-18F1-43C3-ADD7-D0B8878177AD%7D",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city and county are named after Joseph Renville, a French‑Dakota fur trader who founded Fort Renville and guided early expeditions.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
